1933: Americans were ordered to hand in their gold.
1971: the dollar’s last link to gold was cut.

Since then, the money supply has been a policy decision, revised again and again.

ETC’s supply was set in code in 2017. It hasn’t changed since.

ETC is Programmable Digital Gold.